Package: siteforge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: SiteForge contributors <siteforge@example.org>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-webkit-6.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtksource-5, python3-stripe
Homepage: https://github.com/2030nhickman/websitemaker
Description: Visual HTML website builder for GNOME
 SiteForge lets you build web pages by dragging components onto a live
 WebKitGTK preview, edit HTML/CSS/JavaScript with syntax highlighting,
 script pages with Scratch-style visual blocks and add Stripe Checkout.
 Projects are saved as .siteforge files and export to clean HTML.
